                "correctChoiceId": "bounce",
                "explanation": {
                  "correct": "Correct. No volleys inside the kitchen. You'd be surprised how many people get this wrong.",
                  "incorrect": "Fault! You can't volley while standing in the kitchen. Classic rookie move."
